FSDH-YOLO Reproduction Materials

This repository contains a modified copy of Ultralytics YOLO 8.4.11.

Upstream:
  https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics
  License: GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0)

Modifications made for the FSDH-YOLO paper:
  * Added FSDConv as the SPOConv class in
    ultralytics/nn/modules/advanced.py (PixelUnshuffle + Conv-BN-SiLU).
  * Added SHEB as the SHAB class in
    ultralytics/nn/modules/small_object_modules.py
    (local / mid-range / global-channel branches, residual fusion).
  * Registered the new modules in ultralytics/nn/modules/__init__.py and
    ultralytics/nn/tasks.py.
  * Added the FSDH-YOLO and ablation/control model YAML files under
    ultralytics/cfg/models/11/.
  * Added paper-specific training and evaluation wrappers in train/ and eval/.

The trained checkpoints in weights/ were produced by training the modified code
on the two public litchi datasets described in the paper. They are distributed
under the same AGPL-3.0 terms as the code.

Appendix C files under results/Appendix_C/ were copied from
https://github.com/ther608/FSDH-YOLO-Supplementary, which is MIT-licensed.
A copy of that license is in LICENSES/FSDH-YOLO-Supplementary-MIT.txt.

Datasets are not redistributed. Dataset A is the RGB subset of the public RGB-D
lychee dataset of Zhang et al. (arXiv:2510.16800). Dataset B is the public
lichi-maturity dataset of Zhao (Mendeley Data, doi:10.17632/c3rk9gv4w9.1).
Users must obtain the datasets from their original sources and comply with the
original licenses.
